  "sentences": [
    {"text": "A light, playful breeze ruffled the surface of the pond.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "A warm, whispering wind sighed through the long grass.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "A sudden, sharp gust snatched the hat from his head and bowled it down the street.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "For two days a fierce, howling gale battered the coast.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "The wild, shrieking wind tore tiles from the roofs and flung them into the road.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "An icy, biting blast cut through her coat as if it were paper.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "A stiff, salty breeze tugged at the washing.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "All night the wind moaned in the chimney like something shut out.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "A thin, cold draught whistled under the door.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "Whirling eddies of leaves chased each other across the yard.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "Ferocious, buffeting gusts bent the trees double.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "The gale rattled the windows in their frames.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "A bleak, keening wind wailed across the empty moor.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "A breath of air stirred the curtains and was gone.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "A soft, fragrant breeze carried the scent of blossom through the open door.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "The storm roared in the treetops like surf on shingle.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "Towards dawn the wind dropped to a whisper.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "The rusty, creaking weathervane swung wildly from north to east and back again.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "A relentless, driving wind whipped the sea into foam.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "The squall hit without warning and laid the boat on its side.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "Debris swirled down the street: paper, branches, a child's umbrella turned inside out.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "The wind had the hillside to itself.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "There was no sound in the house but the wind trying each window in turn.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "The wind shrieked through the broken pane.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "The wind was full of mischief that morning, lifting skirts and stealing newspapers.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "Kites strained at their strings, and the children leaned back against the pull.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "The wind moved over the barley in long, silver waves.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
